  - The `ipc-os.js` unit-test harness (seeding `require.cache` for
    `require.resolve('electron')` with a getter, then a hand-rolled
    `ipc` stub with `emit`/`count`) transplanted verbatim. Copy
    `makeIpcStub()` for any future shim module that talks to
    `ipcRenderer`; it is ~40 lines and not worth extracting into a
    shared helper until a third file needs it, since `test/unit/*.js`
